subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Run all maintenance tasks (integrity check, VACUUM, prune audit/tags)

USAGE:
  subtrack cleanup <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                         Display this help message
  -v, --version                      Display this version
  --vacuum                           Run VACUUM (default: true)
  --audit-days <audit-days>          Prune audit entries older than N days (default: 90)
  -j, --json                         Output as JSON

